<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1799_6645.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser früntlich willig dienst, und was wir ehren liebs und
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> vermoegend zuvor, fromm, fürsichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear> wyß, inn-
<lb n="3"/>sonders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> fründt, und gethrüw lieb <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unß</unclear>-
<lb n="4"/>er geliebter burgermeister, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herre</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Hanß Ruodolff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rahn</unclear></persName> hat
<lb n="5"/>uns berichtet. Nachdem dann wider all
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhoffen</unclear>, üwers burgers, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">synes</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schwagers</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Christoff</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>Scherers</persName> und mitverwandten sachen und handlungen, sich
<lb n="8"/>(<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leider</unclear>) nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geüebt</unclear>, dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> von deß großen uff
<lb n="9"/>Inen ligenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldenlasts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unversehen</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerathen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ire</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glöubiger</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irem</unclear> hab und guet gegriffen,
<lb n="11"/>und also alle sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nechster</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tagen</unclear> für <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberkheit</unclear>,
<lb n="12"/>zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlütherung</unclear> und rechtlicher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erörtterung</unclear> khomen werd-
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ind</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stuende</unclear> syn liebe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschwyh</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bemelts</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Scherers</unclear></persName> Ee-
<lb n="14"/>fraw, sambt Iren lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khindern</unclear>, und er von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irentwegen</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>Inn sorgen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> sölliche rechtliche handlung ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllichen</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>ußschlag gewinnen möchte, dardurch sy die fraw sambt
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khinderen</unclear>, noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> mehr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jamer</unclear>, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ellend</unclear> und
<lb n="18"/>an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bättelstab</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear> möchten. Derhalben an
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ernstliche</unclear> bitt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">were</unclear>, wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welten</unclear> Ime zuo ehren
<lb n="20"/>und gefallen, und den betrüebten armen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unschuldigen</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>wyb und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khinderen</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diewyl</unclear> er sich dißmals von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> obligenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wichtigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschefften</unclear> wegen selbs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">person</unclear>-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderst</unclear> nit annemen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khönne</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> trost unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetem</unclear>,
<lb n="24"/>ein früntlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürbitlich</unclear> schryben an üch abgehn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, uff
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölliche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyß</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Daß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ire</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frawen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khinderen</unclear> Inn
<lb n="26"/>abhandlung diser der Schererischen sachen, so vil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Immer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syn</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khan</unclear>, und sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear> laßen und verantwortlich syn mag,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschonet</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ansehen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Irer</unclear> unschuld und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyßlose</unclear>,
<lb n="29"/>so vil durch üwer mittel und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ansehen</unclear> geholffen werden
<lb n="30"/>möchte, damit sy nit uff die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gaßen</unclear> geschlagen werdint,
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fraw</unclear> by Iren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khindern</unclear> belyben, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einand</unclear>-
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußen</unclear>, und sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dennocht</unclear> auch erhalten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khönind</unclear>. Der
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> hoffnung, es werde <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> fürbitt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">by</unclear> üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ang</unclear>-
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sehen</unclear>, nit wenig bringen, und die armen wyb und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khinder</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> genießen. Und wann nun wir
<lb n="36"/>deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbarmbd</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> gegen der ehrlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frawen</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1799_6646.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="37"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear> kinderen, von deß unglückhafften <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuostandts</unclear> wegen,
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andem</unclear> sy kein schuld und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlaß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tragend</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bewegt</unclear> sind, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelliche</unclear>,
<lb n="39"/>an uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschechne</unclear> bitt, nit versagen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear>. Unnd
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> darby <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erinneret</unclear>, wie man etwan <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> derglychen fälen
<lb n="41"/>ein übrigs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethan</unclear>, und ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Oberkheit</unclear> nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gstaltsäme</unclear> der
<lb n="42"/>sachen und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">personen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear> khan. So
<lb n="43"/>gelangt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daruf</unclear> an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoessischs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">früntlichs</unclear> bitten.
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellind</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierynnen</unclear> gegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bemeltem</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Scherrers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frouwen</unclear>
<lb n="45"/>und kinderen, so vil <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jmer</unclear> müglich ist und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschechen</unclear> mag,
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> abhandlung der sachen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> also günstig unnd
<lb n="47"/>gnedig erzeigen, das die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betrüebte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frouw</unclear> unnd kinder,
<lb n="48"/>und mit Inen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> gedachter unser geliebter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear>,
<lb n="49"/>der mit und nebent <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear> bittet, diser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserer</unclear>
<lb n="50"/>fürbitt wol gnossen haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spüren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegint</unclear>. Das erbiet=
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">end</unclear> wir uns von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irretwegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> begebender gelegenheit
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoessisch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobeschulden</unclear> und verdienen.
<lb n="53"/>Und thuond üch daby <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Goetlichem</unclear> schirm wol bevolchen.
<lb n="54"/><origDate when="1612" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dato</unclear> den letsten Septembris. Anno 1612.</origDate>
<lb n="55"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> unnd Rath
<lb n="56"/>der Statt Zürich</orgName>.
